---

Note on the underlying data: the UAP records indexed by this project
originate from the U.S. National Archives (Record Group 615) and the U.S.
Department of War (war.gov/UFO/). As works of the U.S. federal government
they are in the public domain (17 U.S.C. § 105). This project adds no
copyright over them; the manifests and code are released CC0.
